* @title String function examples including REPLACE
* @attribution Griswold 1971, Chapter 2
* @expect >>>
* ABCABCABC
* 5
* 0
* TRAILING BLANKSGONE
* sPOOn
* <<<
 OUTPUT = DUPL('ABC', 3)
 OUTPUT = SIZE('ZIPPY')
 OUTPUT = SIZE('')
 OUTPUT = TRIM('TRAILING BLANKS  ') 'GONE'
 OUTPUT = REPLACE('spoon','po','PO')
END
